surface":"防與先生","kind":"person","person_id":"aoj_li6_wuk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"賢人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"賢人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan","book_id":"b-shiji-050","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-050-chuyuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:p011","text":"漢封同姓，楚有令名。既滅韓信，王於彭城。穆生置醴，韋孟作程。王戊棄德，與吳連兵。太后命禮，為楚罪輕。文襄繼立，世挺才英。如何趙遂，代殞厥聲！興亡之兆，所任宜明。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"同姓","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"zqy_y5v_rf6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"穆生","kind":"person","person_id":"716_g9k_cg4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"韋孟","kind":"person","person_id":"6ry_qb7_2ur","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"禮","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_BAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m011-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"趙遂","kind":"person","person_id":"lfb_885_np1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan","book_id":"b-shiji-050","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-050-chuyuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p004","text":"晁錯為太子家令，得幸太子，數從容言吳過可削。數上書說孝文帝，文帝寬，不忍罰，以此吳日益橫。及孝景帝即位，錯為御史大夫，說上曰：「昔高帝初定天下，昆弟少，諸子弱，大封同姓，故王孽子悼惠王王齊七十餘城，庶弟元王王楚四十餘城，兄子濞王吳五十餘城：封三庶孽，分天下半。今吳王前有太子之郄，詐稱病不朝，於古法當誅，文帝弗忍，因賜几杖。德至厚，當改過自新。乃益驕溢，即山鑄錢，煮海水為鹽，誘天下亡人，謀作亂。今削之亦反，不削之亦反。削之，其反亟，禍小；不削，反遲，禍大。」三年冬，楚王朝，晁錯因言楚王戊往年為薄太后服，私姦服舍，請誅之。詔赦，罰削東海郡。因削吳之豫章郡、會稽郡。及前二年趙王有罪，削其河閒郡。膠西王卬以賣爵有姦，削其六縣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"7md_vp9_mh6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hji_k07_9z9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hji_k07_9z9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"孝景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"l15_49l_ofr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"7md_vp9_mh6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0089","start":89,"end":92,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"0un_l4f_n8x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"toa_jp7_ex1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"dlg_vnw_1bi_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hji_k07_9z9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"7md_vp9_mh6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0242","start":242,"end":245,"surface":"楚王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"t7c_140_w64","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0248","start":248,"end":251,"surface":"薄太后","kind":"person","person_id":"xky_ebm_pdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m004-0298","start":298,"end":302,"surface":"膠西王卬","kind":"person","person_id":"gce_k4n_a0o","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","book_id":"b-shiji-106","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p016","text":"二月中，吳王兵既破，敗走，於是天子制詔將軍曰：「蓋聞為善者天報之以福；為非者天報之以殃。高皇帝親表功德，建立諸侯，幽王、悼惠王絕無後，孝文皇帝哀憐加惠，王幽王子遂、悼惠王子卬等，令奉其先王宗廟，為漢藩國，德配天地，明并日月。吳王濞倍德反義，誘受天下亡命罪人，亂天下幣，稱病不朝二十餘年，有司數請濞罪，孝文皇帝寬之，欲其改行為善。今乃與楚王戊、趙王遂、膠西王卬、濟南王辟光、菑川王賢、膠東王雄渠約從反，為逆無道，起兵以危宗廟，賊殺大臣及漢使者，迫劫萬民，夭殺無罪，燒殘民家，掘其丘冢，甚為暴虐。今卬等又重逆無道，燒宗廟，鹵御物，朕甚痛之。朕素服避正殿，將軍其勸士大夫擊反虜。擊反虜者，深入多殺為功，斬首捕虜比三百石以上者皆殺之，無有所置。敢有議詔及不如詔者，皆要斬。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"dlg_vnw_1bi_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"高皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"uav_hdp_d1y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"wxp_4en_jt3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"0un_l4f_n8x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0067","start":67,"end":71,"surface":"孝文皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hji_k07_9z9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"wxp_4en_jt3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"0un_l4f_n8x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0112","start":112,"end":115,"surface":"吳王濞","kind":"person","person_id":"dlg_vnw_1bi_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0150","start":150,"end":154,"surface":"孝文皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hji_k07_9z9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0167","start":167,"end":170,"surface":"楚王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"t7c_140_w64","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0171","start":171,"end":174,"surface":"趙王遂","kind":"person","person_id":"j0k_rij_w1l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0175","start":175,"end":179,"surface":"膠西王卬","kind":"person","person_id":"gce_k4n_a0o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0180","start":180,"end":185,"surface":"濟南王辟光","kind":"person","person_id":"5pd_com_pg9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0186","start":186,"end":190,"surface":"菑川王賢","kind":"person","person_id":"9w0_nfw_c31","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m016-0191","start":191,"end":196,"surface":"膠東王雄渠","kind":"person","person_id":"uf4_v5w_uon","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","book_id":"b-shiji-106","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p017","text":"初，吳王之度淮，與楚王遂西敗棘壁，乘勝前，銳甚。梁孝王恐，遣六將軍擊吳，又敗梁兩將，士卒皆還走梁。梁數使使報條侯求救，條侯不許。又使使惡條侯於上，上使人告條侯救梁，復守便宜不行。梁使韓安國及楚死事相弟張羽為將軍，乃得頗敗吳兵。吳兵欲西，梁城守堅，不敢西，即走條侯軍，會下邑。欲戰，條侯壁，不肯戰。吳糧絕，卒饑，數挑戰，遂夜奔條侯壁，驚東南。條侯使備西北，果從西北入。吳大敗，士卒多饑死，乃畔散。於是吳王乃與其麾下壯士數千人夜亡去，度江走丹徒，保東越。東越兵可萬餘人，乃使人收聚亡卒。漢使人以利啗東越，東越即紿吳王，吳王出勞軍，即使人鏦殺吳王，盛其頭，馳傳以聞。吳王子子華、子駒亡走閩越。吳王之棄其軍亡也，軍遂潰，往往稍降太尉、梁軍。楚王戊軍敗，自殺。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"dlg_vnw_1bi_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"34n_xv3_etx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"t3i_l5f_u0p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"t3i_l5f_u0p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"t3i_l5f_u0p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"t3i_l5f_u0p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"hfn_aif_jww","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0095","start":95,"end":99,"surface":"楚死事相","kind":"person","person_id":"tae_3uh_xsc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"張羽","kind":"person","person_id":"fwu_nkh_9qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"t3i_l5f_u0p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0140","start":140,"end":142,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"t3i_l5f_u0p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person